ts/725051394","actor":{"login":"whizark","id":1211058,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTEwNTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1211058?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark","html_url":"https://github.com/whizark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whizark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"cea02914308748b417bd60c9f2b34c59421d4aaa","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whizark/eslint-config/commits/cea02914308748b417bd60c9f2b34c59421d4aaa","created_at":"2016-07-16T01:33:10Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/233143017","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/6691#issuecomment-233143017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/6691","id":233143017,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzMzE0MzAxNw==","user":{"login":"btmills","id":1709537,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDk1Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1709537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills","html_url":"https://github.com/btmills","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-07-16T18:01:09Z","updated_at":"2016-07-16T18:01:09Z","body":"The object `align` option applies to properties that are in a group and can be aligned. Try the `case1.js` config on this:\n\n``` js\nvar a = {\n    foo   :    1,\n    align1:    {\n        foo: 2\n    },\n    align2: {\n        foo: 3\n    },\n    bar: 4\n};\n```\n\nSince `foo` and `align1` are the only properties on adjacent lines in the same object literal, they're the only ones where `align` applies. All of the other properties are individual and will follow the rules for a `multiLine` object literal. Assuming that modified example passes, I think we're good on that part.\n\nAs for the schema error, that is a bug. `key-spacing` has a pretty complex schema, so `mode` was probably omitted by mistake.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/233143017/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"btmills","id":1709537,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDk1Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1709537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills","html_url":"https://github.com/btmills","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/sta